          "id": "9b25370475564ce7102d14682df7b08d65efe946",
          "message": "feat(play): say why the turn can't pay for an action (#1084)\n\nThe All view listed actions the turn cannot pay for without saying why.\nThey now carry a reason: \"Needs 2 actions, 1 left\", \"Not your turn\" or\n\"Reaction already spent\", worded through message keys with a plural.\n\nOff turn, a free action with no trigger is held back as well; only\nreactions and free actions with a trigger are offered there.\n\nRefs #356\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-18T08:29:31+10:00",
          "tree_id": "2d3c8853829f43791b3b2ea9bb58619380182b40",
