          "id": "b48eaefd79288a20bcef08f70fe18fbb2f5eee3d",
          "message": "feat(campaign): promote a flagged item to a key item (#1091)\n\nThe GM can make a rule-breaking item a key item from the Needs review\nlist, after a confirmation naming the item and its holder. The key item\ncopies the base item, runes and name from the line, and the line is\nlinked to it rather than a second one being added.\n\nThe key item id is derived from the campaign and the line, and the key\nitem is created before the line is linked, so a retry after a failure\npart-way cannot leave two key items for one line.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-18T17:15:28+10:00",
          "tree_id": "556215628c743fd948eec2764045c607328def55",
