          "id": "e48ba3cf288fa2c42c952854da83e307fef8b322",
          "message": "fix(ci): follow the fighter and oracle rule indices, drop dead exports (#1309)\n\nThe deity feat category import added rules to the Player Core fighter\nclass, moving its feat ChoiceSets from 27/29/31 to 31/33/35, and the\nPlayer Core 2 flames feature's deity ChoiceSet from 4 to 8. Three sheet\nspecs still named the old indices, so main CI went red.\n\nAlso unexport the symbols knip reports as unused.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
