          "id": "acc47cef995980cc921d1d3684c5316ab67e8533",
          "message": "fix(play): suffocation puts the Unconscious condition on the character (#1335)\n\nRunning out of air now adds the content's Unconscious condition through\nthe normal condition path, and the breath remembers the instance.\nBreathing again (clearBreath, or air set above none) removes that\ninstance and leaves any other Unconscious alone.\n\nCloses #1247\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
