          "message": "fix(character): type the three test fixtures character-domain rejects (#1374)\n\nThe environment-time, rest-actions and roll-persona tests failed the\ncharacter-domain typecheck: an unbranded elapsed value, a play limits\nobject without environmentGroups, and a name table compared by brand.\n\nThe order-explorer failures from the ticket no longer reproduce on main.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
